  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Au café, Clara commande pour la famille.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂໍກາເຟສອງຈອກ ແລະເຝີສາມຖ້ວຍ</span><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̌ɔ kǎa-féé sɔ̌ɔng jɔ̏ɔk, lɛ́ fɤ̌ɤ sǎam thûay.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄົນຂາຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ມີຈັກຄົນ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Míi ják khón?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສີ່ຄົນ</span><span class=\"rom\">Sìi khón.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄົນຂາຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເອົານ້ຳຈັກແກ້ວ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Ǎo nȁam ják kɛ̂ɛw?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສີ່ແກ້ວ ຂອບໃຈ</span><span class=\"rom\">Sìi kɛ̂ɛw. Khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy.</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Clara</b> — Deux cafés et trois bols de pho, s&#x27;il vous plaît.<br><b>La vendeuse</b> — Vous êtes combien ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Quatre.<br><b>La vendeuse</b> — Combien de verres d&#x27;eau ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Quatre verres. Merci.</p></details>"
